ategories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"lkViWrwOjLTv0JWq10S59g","review_id":"SiXpuB2w4ESmaGbnPmZB7g","date":"2021-06-18T19:01:13","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9312564134597778,"text_excerpt":"This was my favorite shop in New Orleans. I forgot to take pics of all the candies we got but they have all sorts of tasty sweet treats. The ice cream bar is fabulous. Lots of selections and the waffle cones had some fun dipped options as well. I did the butterfinger waffle cone with my butter pecan ice cream. That was fantastic. The apples if you put in the fridge and eat later and twice as good as from the counter! I got two and noticed a huge difference. They offer to cut them there if you want to eat it now or you can do it later. I thought that was super nice of them. They staff was very friendly and I personally prefer shopping at small local businesses. I would totally go back. The..."},{"business_id":"lkViWrwOjLTv0JWq10S59g","review_id":"sgDehmeAv68envrNyprF9Q","date":"2015-04-09T04:59:42","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9309138059616089,"text_excerpt":"\"Seeing the candy apples in the window will lure you in\". After lunch last weekend, this was a definite stop for us on our way back to our car. It's a small, corner shop, but the treats are made with love. I ordered the chocolate-caramel apple! It was luscious and the caramel was oooey-gooey good! They sliced it for us before they wrapped it, so we were able to easily consume in the car on the way home. My only complaint was that it started to water after I left the other half in the fridge, so that made me a bit nervous. Other than that, I really enjoyed the apple, from what we got to consume of it. The prices were comparable to other candy apples I have purchased in the past. Even thoug..."},{"business_id":"lkViWrwOjLTv0JWq10S59g","review_id":"5egYPFCuWIEERWu4xSgSug","date":"2015-02-19T01:15:13","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9166361689567566,"text_excerpt":"If I told you that my boyfriend has decided to drive 70 miles to New Orleans just for a candy apple, you would think we were crazy. Please don't judge us. If it helps he is in culinary school. We first came across this sticky jewel one Saturday afternoon during our stroll on Magazine St. We chose the Butterfinger candy apple and it was crunchy, sticky and the apple was fresh as fresh can get. Apples are 8 bucks, which can be a little on the moderate side for a treat, but its worth it every once in a while. Plus there is a Yelp deal where you can get $5 dollars for $10 dollar deal at Mister Apple. Be sure to check it out. Who could ask for more? Needless to say, the last two check ins we h..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"lkViWrwOjLTv0JWq10S59g","photo_id":"EHfIpYWfaU97BoxZCTVE3A","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/EHfIpYWfaU97BoxZCTVE3A.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9547491073608398},{"business_id":"lkViWrwOjLTv0JWq10S59g","photo_id":"ZzaH5BQjkD56ACqBiqJajA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/ZzaH5BQjkD56ACqBiqJajA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8926942348480225},{"business_id":"lkViWrwOjLTv0JWq10S59g","photo_id":"HoCRi0z6zhcXzQ7dA7_T5Q","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/HoCRi0z6zhcXzQ7dA7_T5Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8893731832504272},{"business_id":"lkViWrwOjLTv0JWq10S59g","photo_id":"G4LdICXr44JQFR1oyGqZYg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/G4LdICXr44JQFR1oyGqZYg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8051249384880066}]},"notebook_case":null}
